    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grinding Guilds mixes Auto Battler with RPG elements. Pick your hero, level up and upgrade abilities. Hire allies for your guild and equip your units to create unique builds. Fight hordes of enemies and defeat all bosses to reclaim the regions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Active and Auto mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your hero and lead your guild to victory, or sit back and watch them battle hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/9651e3292d57913e115a2a137aa8fce9.poster.avif?t=1753878977\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/9651e3292d57913e115a2a137aa8fce9.webm?t=1753878977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/9651e3292d57913e115a2a137aa8fce9.mp4?t=1753878977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble your guild</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of allies with unique abilities to choose from and create your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/58c5bd91759afb5eb3db7bee1e4f805f.avif?t=1753878977\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equip your units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each unit can be equipped with up to 6 items that greatly modify their stats. 4 extra slots can be equipped with powerful Pacts that can provide benefits to the whole party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/80eeffb4ad3bbbad22ab178b9ca006e9.poster.avif?t=1753878977\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/80eeffb4ad3bbbad22ab178b9ca006e9.webm?t=1753878977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/80eeffb4ad3bbbad22ab178b9ca006e9.mp4?t=1753878977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill trees</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your abilities and customize them. Each ability has its own skill tree with multiple upgrades for you to create amazing builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/efaa41fac9ced70f8bc66250c10ad628.poster.avif?t=1753878977\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/efaa41fac9ced70f8bc66250c10ad628.webm?t=1753878977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/efaa41fac9ced70f8bc66250c10ad628.mp4?t=1753878977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your battles, defeating a boss region will unlock new crafting recipes and new allies. Grind your way against increasingly harder enemies, defeat all bosses and reclaim all regions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/a9ce92c242843c331f70de2628ebe98d.avif?t=1753878977\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grinding Guilds mixes Auto Battler with RPG elements. Pick your hero, level up and upgrade abilities. Hire allies for your guild and equip your units to create unique builds. Fight hordes of enemies and defeat all bosses to reclaim the regions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Active and Auto mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your hero and lead your guild to victory, or sit back and watch them battle hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/9651e3292d57913e115a2a137aa8fce9.poster.avif?t=1753878977\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/9651e3292d57913e115a2a137aa8fce9.webm?t=1753878977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/9651e3292d57913e115a2a137aa8fce9.mp4?t=1753878977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assemble your guild</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of allies with unique abilities to choose from and create your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/58c5bd91759afb5eb3db7bee1e4f805f.avif?t=1753878977\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equip your units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each unit can be equipped with up to 6 items that greatly modify their stats. 4 extra slots can be equipped with powerful Pacts that can provide benefits to the whole party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/80eeffb4ad3bbbad22ab178b9ca006e9.poster.avif?t=1753878977\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/80eeffb4ad3bbbad22ab178b9ca006e9.webm?t=1753878977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/80eeffb4ad3bbbad22ab178b9ca006e9.mp4?t=1753878977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill trees</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your abilities and customize them. Each ability has its own skill tree with multiple upgrades for you to create amazing builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/efaa41fac9ced70f8bc66250c10ad628.poster.avif?t=1753878977\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/efaa41fac9ced70f8bc66250c10ad628.webm?t=1753878977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/efaa41fac9ced70f8bc66250c10ad628.mp4?t=1753878977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your battles, defeating a boss region will unlock new crafting recipes and new allies. Grind your way against increasingly harder enemies, defeat all bosses and reclaim all regions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299780/extras/a9ce92c242843c331f70de2628ebe98d.avif?t=1753878977\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"